<title>USA: Valujet Jan load factor falls to 41.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Valujet Jan load factor falls to 41.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997		  1996</p>
<p> Load factor - percent     41.5		48.5</p>
<p> Revenue passenger miles   64,643	    198,592</p>
<p> Available seat miles	155,646	   409,307</p>
<p>(Revenue passenger and available seat miles in 000s)</p>
<p>NOTES: Full name of company is ValuJet Airlines Inc.</p>
<p>Company had 18 aircraft in service in January 1997 vs 41 for the same period a year earlier.</p>
</text>
